   "id": "cb_483233421f83dc55e63e4a1f",
   "order": 16,
   "title_en": "Highlights",
   "body_en": "• Extraordinary UV Resistance\n• Exceptional Temperature Resistance\n• High Impact Strength and Durability\n• Outdoor Use for Long-Term Purpose\n• Comes with High Temperature Reusable Spool\n• Cautions for Use",
   "url": "",
